# Git LFS — binary art assets (added 2026-08-12, Milestone 2 Phase 0)
#
# Set up BEFORE the first binary asset landed, deliberately: retrofitting LFS
# means rewriting history, force-pushing, and breaking every existing clone.
#
# Patterns are scoped to assets/ ON PURPOSE. A blanket "*.png" would also
# capture the icons already committed under addons/ (Dialogic, Phantom Camera,
# GUT), which are small, already in history, and none of our business. Scoping
# keeps LFS to art we author or import.
#
# Not covered here, by design: .tscn, .tres, .gd, .import sidecars, .gdshader.
# Those are plain text, stay diffable, and are the reproducible half of the
# project per CLAUDE.md.

# 3D models — glTF is the project's interchange format (see docs/ART_PIPELINE.md)
assets/**/*.glb   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
assets/**/*.gltf  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
assets/**/*.bin   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
assets/**/*.fbx   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Blender sources (assets/source/, which Godot is told to ignore via .gdignore)
assets/**/*.blend  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
assets/**/*.blend1 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Textures — flat-shaded low-poly needs few of these, but the style could grow
assets/**/*.png  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
assets/**/*.jpg  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
assets/**/*.jpeg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
assets/**/*.tga  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
assets/**/*.exr  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
assets/**/*.hdr  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# Audio — included now though M2's audio pass isn't scoped yet. Costs nothing
# today and avoids a second "should have done LFS first" moment later.
assets/**/*.wav filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
assets/**/*.ogg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
assets/**/*.mp3 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
